ype":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"まあUSBメモリと比べるとどうしても遅いですからね、CDやDVD","ts":"1628759159.061300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GwUuS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd12adab-40b2-4c6f-92fb-946c86f8366b","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"このあたりでライブCD/DVDの概念が消えて「ライブUSB」という言葉が増えてきてたような気もします。Ubuntu 10.04 LTSをUSBメモリでブートしてみようみたいな記事も見かけましたし。","ts":"1628758591.060500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iy9uC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69a39bd0-f9ab-4779-a407-08d05d912882","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"価格破壊が起きたのは2009～2010年あたりみたいですね。\n\u003chttp://blog.livedoor.jp/remsy/archives/52258350.html\u003e","ts":"1628758343.058900","attachments":[{"fallback":"鳥取の社長日記: 約10年前、USBメモリ（4GB）の価格は1万円オーバーだった : 鳥取の社長日記","id":1,"title":"約10年前、USBメモリ（4GB）の価格は1万円オーバーだった : 鳥取の社長日記","title_link":"http://blog.livedoor.jp/remsy/archives/52258350.html","text":"このごろはUSBメモリの価格が〜、というより、USBメモリ自体をほとんど使わなくなりましたよね。もっと言えば、PC自体を持っていない人が増えています。 スマートフォンが主流となった今、データの移動や保存はWi-Fiやクラウドなどのインターネット経由でおこなうように","image_url":"https://livedoor.blogimg.jp/remsy/imgs/1/6/16748b93.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"鳥取の社長日記","service_icon":"http://blog.livedoor.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://blog.livedoor.jp/remsy/archives/52258350.html","original_url":"http://blog.livedoor.jp/remsy/archives/52258350.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BcYS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6254fd87-e6c1-44a3-b4b6-10761bbca239","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一応Amazonでは2009年当時、4GBのUSBメモリを1400円未満で買ってた。なお秋葉原の店頭ではもう少し安かった気がする。","ts":"1628758175.057600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3ydw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7074085c-7a32-49e5-8faa-1cb6f24320f9","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"たぶん2009年時点で4GBかなり安かったんじゃないかな…","ts":"1628758012.056300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8d1c2bf-9e1b-44a7-9da5-97ca024bd197","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"MLC技術が確立され始めてからガクッと価格が落ちましたよね。","ts":"1628757874.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kt0B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1743c74b-7880-4a63-bf9c-98bde09ca9f2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ばかなのかな?w","ts":"1628757652.054600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OKs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd056922-d3e9-4d04-aa56-70a685d8c025","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"2009年にもやってるなwww\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/359320655881179138\u003e","ts":"1628757646.054300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: 4年前に別の16ポートのUSBハブでやろうと思ってUSBメモリを買い揃えたんだけど、忙しかったのとポートの配置の関係で見栄えが悪そうなのでお蔵入りしてた。しかし先日、良い形のハブを見つけたのでお蔵出しとなりましたw","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/359320655881179138","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"4年前に別の16ポートのUSBハブでやろうと思ってUSBメモリを買い揃えたんだけど、忙しかったのとポートの配置の関係で見栄えが悪そうなのでお蔵入りしてた。しかし先日、良い形のハブを見つけたのでお蔵出しとなりましたw","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1374503694,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/359320655881179138","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/359320655881179138"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":1,"users":["UGJG6S9JM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QGDy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be57b5b6-a0cd-4c74-a3c3-8f4517f4b648","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"2013くらいか